🔁 Replay Recipe

Rebuilds every metric and audit flag using:
• Original transcript
• Canonicalized token/utterance stream
• Deterministic logic modules (DIS, WSM, CCI)
• Bound-entropy constraints

Any mismatch produces tamper_code: deposition_modified.

